てをつなごう
Let's join hands!

680
00:53:15,620 --> 00:53:16,970
ゲーマーズの戌神ころねです！
I'm Korone from Gamers!

681
00:53:20,250 --> 00:53:23,780
たてんしのにんげん…、いや。雪花のラミィです！
I'm Lamy from Gen 5!

682
00:53:24,160 --> 00:53:27,160
５期生の、雪花のラミィです！ ３期の、宝鐘マリンです！
And I'm Marine from Gen 3!

683
00:53:27,700 --> 00:53:31,100
３期の、白銀ノエルです！
I'm Noel from Gen 3!

684
00:53:35,260 --> 00:53:37,460
なかよしすてっぷ！
Let's get along!

685
00:53:43,790 --> 00:53:45,420
うちだってけっこう裏で話すから、もう話すことないんだよね。
Well, we talk about everything backstage, so we don't really have anything left to talk about!

686
00:53:47,460 --> 00:53:48,410
じゃあ、開催しました！
So, the live is basically over!

687
00:53:50,120 --> 00:53:52,350
ありがとうございました！バイバーイ！
Thank you very much! Bye-bye!

688
00:53:54,620 --> 00:53:58,700
３、２、１、あ… なっちゃって？
Three, two, one, and...

689
00:54:00,941 --> 00:54:02,211
で、何話すんだっけ？
What are we supposed to talk about again?

690
00:54:03,661 --> 00:54:05,231
あ、今日のさ、目的は何だっけ？
Oh right, today's purpose!

691
00:54:05,881 --> 00:54:07,801
そうだよ、なんで呼ばれたのかわかってないよ、だんだん。
That's right, why were we called here?

692
00:54:09,601 --> 00:54:14,441
実はね、船長ちょっと…し、あ、ちょっと、言えないけど…し、言えないの？
Well, you see... the captain has a... well, I shouldn't say it, but...

693
00:54:15,011 --> 00:54:16,881
重大発表があって…
A major announcement!

694
00:54:17,731 --> 00:54:19,071
なに？え、何々？聞かせて、聞かせて！
What? What? Let me hear it!

695
00:54:20,671 --> 00:54:24,551
実は…この次、発表なんですよ！え！？本当！？
Actually... the next announcement is happening right after this!

696
00:54:25,611 --> 00:54:26,631
この後すぐ！？本当！？
Right after this? Seriously?

697
00:54:27,841 --> 00:54:29,021
じゃあ早く見たいからもう終わるか。
Well, if we want to see it quickly, we should just end the stream!

698
00:54:30,301 --> 00:54:32,041
そうね、じゃあ開催して。
Right, let's end it!

699
00:54:32,501 --> 00:54:35,401
ありがとうございました！バイバーイ！
Thank you very much! Bye-bye!

700
00:54:35,881 --> 00:54:39,191
３、２、１、あ、なっちゃって！
Three, two, one, and... oops!

701
00:54:40,481 --> 00:54:42,421
みんな…
Everyone...

702
00:55:00,428 --> 00:55:01,468
私のもの そう私のもの
Mine, yes, my mine,

703
00:55:01,468 --> 00:55:02,808
千の黄金
a thousand golds.

704
00:55:02,808 --> 00:55:04,268
数百年の財宝 この船に眠る
Centuries of treasure sleep in this ship.

705
00:55:04,268 --> 00:55:06,188
古びた伝説は 呪われた幽霊船に
The ancient legend leads to a cursed ghost ship

706
00:55:06,188 --> 00:55:07,588
続く夜の潮路
along the night's tide.

707
00:55:07,588 --> 00:55:10,088
そこに富が残る 海賊の夢があるのなら
If there's wealth left, if there's a pirate's dream,

708
00:55:10,088 --> 00:55:11,838
頂くしかないでしょ?
you have to take it, don't you?

709
00:55:11,838 --> 00:55:13,488
無謀な赤よ 若き盗人よ
Oh reckless red, oh young thief,

710
00:55:13,488 --> 00:55:15,988
命をもっテ 後悔に代えさせてやろう
I'll make you pay for it with your life.

711
00:55:16,088 --> 00:55:17,888
止まない雨の弾丸で
With unrelenting bullet rain,

712
00:55:17,888 --> 00:55:19,888
駆け来る鼓動 まだこの足走れるはず
Racing heartbeat, these legs should still be able to run

713
00:55:19,888 --> 00:55:22,088
美しいほど この瞳焦がす 生命の炎
So beautiful, the flame of life scorching these eyes,

714
00:55:22,088 --> 00:55:24,588
ガーネットの色彩 掠め 宝石ななら
Grazing the garnet colors, if they are jewels,

715
00:55:24,588 --> 00:55:26,588
ガーネットの色彩 貴方にはない
Garnet hues that you do not possess.

716
00:55:26,588 --> 00:55:29,088
私のもの そう私のもの 奪ってみろ
Mine, yes, my mine, try and take them.

717
00:55:29,088 --> 00:55:31,588
命の証を 貴方の求める全てを
The proof of life, everything you desire.

718
00:55:31,588 --> 00:55:34,088
輝きはくすんで 錆びついて
The brilliance fades, rusting away,

719
00:55:34,088 --> 00:55:36,088
それでも 泥舟にしがみつくなら
yet if you cling to a sinking ship,

720
00:55:36,088 --> 00:55:37,588
泡沫と共に沈め
sink along with the bubbles.

721
00:55:37,588 --> 00:55:39,588
黒い帆に 隠れる
Hidden in the black sails,

722
00:55:39,588 --> 00:55:40,588
“極上の海賊の秘宝”
“The supreme pirate's treasure”

723
00:55:51,088 --> 00:55:54,588
マリン出航！！ 作詞:砂守岳央 作曲:田中公平
[Title: Marine Shukkou!! / Lyrics: Takeo Sunamori, Music: Kohei Tanaka]

724
00:56:03,188 --> 00:56:06,588
世界が 壊れてゆく
The world is breaking apart,

725
00:56:06,588 --> 00:56:10,088
懐かしい声が 聞こえていた
a nostalgic voice could be heard.

726
00:56:10,088 --> 00:56:14,588
汚れタ拳 痛むほど 強く握った
Clenching my bruised fist so hard it aches,

727
00:56:17,588 --> 00:56:22,088
当たり前に笑っていた昨日は もうどこにもない
Yesterday, when I smiled so naturally, is nowhere to be found.

728
00:56:22,088 --> 00:56:26,088
明日がどんな日になるのか 誰も知らない
No one knows what kind of day tomorrow will be.

729
00:56:26,088 --> 00:56:31,588
稼ぎにさえ見捨てられた今日を取り戻すこと誓う
I swear to take back today, abandoned even by earnings.

730
00:56:31,588 --> 00:56:36,088
錨上げ
Raise the anchor,

731
00:56:36,088 --> 00:56:43,088
世界の果てへ 旅立とう
let's set sail to the end of the world!

732
00:56:43,088 --> 00:56:46,088
嵐の海
To the stormy sea,

733
00:56:46,088 --> 00:56:50,088
立ち上がれ
stand up!

734
00:56:50,088 --> 00:56:53,088
幸せは望めば
If you wish for happiness,

735
00:56:53,088 --> 00:56:57,088
手に入るほど 弱くはない
it's not weak enough to just fall into your hands.

736
00:56:57,088 --> 00:57:03,088
守るために戦うなら 楽園なんて
If you fight to protect it, a paradise like that

737
00:57:03,088 --> 00:57:06,588
ならなくていい
doesn't even need to be.

738
00:57:06,588 --> 00:57:12,088
誰がいい 誰が悪者とか
Who is good, who is the villain—

739
00:57:12,088 --> 00:57:16,588
切り返すこともできない
there's no turning back from that.

740
00:57:42,188 --> 00:57:46,088
捨てられた 簡単に
Easily discarded,

741
00:57:46,088 --> 00:57:53,588
灰の中 消えてしまう 奇跡を ただ見ることが 許されないなら
if we aren't even allowed to just witness the miracle vanishing in the ashes,

742
00:57:56,088 --> 00:58:02,088
ひとりきりで震えていた 弱い自分 じゃあはしない
I won't be that weak self trembling all alone anymore,

743
00:58:02,088 --> 00:58:07,088
それでも決意 胸に抱けば もう迷わない
yet if I hold resolve in my chest, I will hesitate no more.

744
00:58:10,588 --> 00:58:17,088
道半ばで 倒れたともに
To the comrades who fell halfway,

745
00:58:17,088 --> 00:58:24,088
託された 言葉抱き
embracing the words entrusted to me.

746
00:58:24,088 --> 00:58:29,088
錨上げ 自由の旗上げ
Raise the anchor, raise the flag of freedom!

747
00:58:34,088 --> 00:58:41,088
大海原 燃え上がれ どんな雨だろとも
Burn up, vast ocean, no matter what rain falls,

748
00:58:41,088 --> 00:58:45,088
ひるむことなく 炎になれ
without flinching, become the flame!

749
00:58:45,088 --> 00:58:51,088
錨上げ 自由の旗上げ
Raise the anchor, raise the flag of freedom!

750
00:58:57,088 --> 00:59:04,088
大海原 燃え上がれ どんな雨だろとも
Burn up, vast ocean, no matter what rain falls,

751
00:59:04,088 --> 00:59:08,088
ひるむことなく 炎になれ
without flinching, become the flame!

752
00:59:19,088 --> 00:59:29,088
よほほはーろへー よほほはーろへー
Heave-ho, heave-ho...

753
00:59:36,088 --> 00:59:43,088
待ち焦がれの勝利の悧得
Waiting eagerly for the spoils of victory,

754
00:59:43,088 --> 00:59:52,088
立ち上がれ よほほはーろへー...
stand up, heave-ho...

755
01:00:00,176 --> 01:00:01,496
おいで！ いざなる
Come on! Now is the time

756
01:00:01,976 --> 01:00:04,696
快速だんだん 光あれえ！
Full speed ahead, let there be light!

757
01:00:05,276 --> 01:00:07,936
光あれえ！
Let there be light!

758
01:00:08,476 --> 01:00:11,836
出航！！
Set sail!!

759
01:00:21,896 --> 01:00:24,456
船長の新曲「マリン出航！！」
The Captain's new song, "Marine Shukkou!!"

